WEBVTT

1
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:16,430
Brother Ling, your black horse doesn’t recognize me.

2
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:18,030
No, I can't outrun him

3
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:20,430
That's because your skills are not good enough

4
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,120
What's wrong? Why is Lingyuan gone?

5
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:26,020
Ask him himself, are you sure you are coming today?

6
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:31,120
You see, I sent him the location and he told me how to get here.

7
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,880
You should take a taxi or take the subway.

8
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:35,830
Damn, he looks so simple and honest

9
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,230
I probably came here by subway.

10
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:38,950
It's not convenient to take a taxi here.

11
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:43,640
Okay, my question is, I'll pick him up.

12
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:47,410
Then I'll go over there and have a look.

13
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:51,820
I don’t want to disturb you as you relax and recuperate.
